1	Parent map + paths	O(n)	O(n)	❌ Mostly educational
2	Recursive 3-part traversal	O(n)	O(h)	⭐ Best
3	Iterative 3-part traversal	O(n)	O(h)	⭐ Very good
4	Morris traversal	O(n)	O(1)	Advanced

For GFG/interviews, Approach 2 is the one you should remember.

